{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Photos 2 PDF Pro 能把相片、掃描檔及文件轉成清晰 PDF，並控制檔案大小。你可裁剪、旋轉、銳化相片，加入邊框、圓角或陰影，再調整頁面順序。程式支援匯入 Word、PowerPoint、Pages 及網頁等檔案，自訂紙張尺寸與每頁版面，並以品質預設或指定大小（如 19 MB）壓縮，方便符合附件限制。完成後可先預覽，再經郵件傳送或儲存至 Files。</p>\n\n<h2>相片文件轉換與壓縮</h2>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-157-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-158-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-159-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-160-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Photos 2 PDF Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T23:59:02.505548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}